name=minesweeper
version=1.0.0
description=Classic mine-clearing puzzle played with the mouse.
details=9 by 9 board with 10 mines. Left click reveals a cell, right click plants a flag, click the header to start over. The first reveal is always safe. Written in C against the EL0 window syscalls.
category=Games
icon=AppGeneric
kind=gui
license=MIT
exec=/apps/minesweeper
build_c=src/minesweeper.c -> /apps/minesweeper
